  "title": "Sun, 16, upsets Bucsa in Beijing; Zheng advances after Kalinskaya retires",
  "description": "Two generations of Chinese tennis scored second-round wins at the China Open on Saturday -- 16-year-old Sun Xinran continued her breakthrough with an upset of Cristina Bucsa, while Zheng Qinwen advanced when Anna Kalinskaya was forced to retire due to illness.",
